      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Resource Property Management are delighted to bring this beautiful, modern three-bedroom property to the rental market.\n\n*****Due to high demand for rental properties, we are only accepting online applications. Please note that phone applications will not be accepted*******\n\nThe property is finished to a high standard throughout, offering bright, contemporary and comfortable living accommodation. It comprises three well-proportioned bedrooms, with the main bedroom benefiting from an ensuite bathroom. The property also features a modern kitchen and spacious living areas, creating a welcoming and stylish home.\n\nIdeally located, the property is within easy reach of local amenities, shops, schools, cafés and transport links, while also providing convenient access to Limerick City Centre and surrounding areas.\n\n"
